 "text": "Fillmore County, MN\nSkip to main content\nSearch\nGo\nHome\nAbout\nAbout Fillmore County\nCities, Townships & Schools\nLive, Work & Play\nResidents\nCounty Services\nCommunity Services\nChild Support\nFinancial Assistance\nFoster Care Licensing\nPublic Health\nSocial Services\nVeteran Services\nCourts & Legal\nAttorney\nDistrict Court\nMedical Examiner\nProbation\nSheriff\nExtension\nLandfill & Recycling\nPublic Safety\nSheriff\nEmergency Management\nGovernment\nCommissioners\nCommittees\nBudget\nDistrict Map\nMeetings (Agendas & Minutes)\nOrdinances\nDepartments\nAdministration/HR\nAirport\nAssessor\nAttorney\nAuditor/Treasurer\nElections\nLicenses & Permits\nPassports\nHemp & Cannabis\nCommunity Services\nPublic Health\nSocial Services\nVeteran Services\nDistrict Court\nEconomic Development\nExtension\nFinance Department\nHighway Department\nPermits and Forms\nLandfill & Recycling\nMedical Examiner\nCommunity Corrections\nVictim Services\nRecorder\nBirth and Death Certificates\nSheriff\nEmergency Management\nCounty Jail\nSoil & Water Conservation District\nSurveyor\nLand Use\nGIS\nFeedlot\nHow Do I\nContact\nGeneral Information\nReport an Issue\nSearch County Services\nSearch FAQs\nSelect Language ​ ▼\nTranslate\nAfrikaans\nAlbanian\nArabic\nArmenian\nAzerbaijani\nBasque\nBelarusian\nBengali\nBosnian\nBulgarian\nCatalan\nCebuano\nChinese (Simplified)\nChinese (Traditional)\nCroatian\nCzech\nDanish\nDutch\nEnglish\nEsperanto\nEstonian\nFilipino\nFinnish\nFrench\nGalician\nGeorgian\nGerman\nGreek\nGujarati\nHaitian Creole\nHausa\nHebrew\nHindi\nHmong\nHungarian\nIcelandic\nIgbo\nIndonesian\nIrish\nItalian\nJapanese\nJavanese\nKannada\nKhmer\nKorean\nLao\nLatin\nLatvian\nLithuanian\nMacedonian\nMalay\nMaltese\nMaori\nMarathi\nMongolian\nNepali\nNorwegian\nPersian\nPolish\nPortuguese\nPunjabi\nRomanian\nRussian\nSerbian\nSlovak\nSlovenian\nSomali\nSpanish\nSwahili\nSwedish\nTamil\nTelugu\nThai\nTurkish\nUkrainian\nUrdu\nVietnamese\nWelsh\nYiddish\nYoruba\nZulu\n1\nPrev Next\nRecorder\nSub Menu\nRelated Pages\nAbstract Fee Schedule\nApplication for iDoc Access\nApplication for ARCA Search\nParcel Split & Septic Compliance Policy\nRecorder FAQs\nRecording Fee Schedule\nRecorder Services\nBirth and Death Certificates\nUniform Conveyancing Blanks- Real Estate Forms\nUpcoming Events/Meetings\nFull calendar\nHome\nDepartments\nRecorder\nMonday - Friday\n8 am-4:30 pm\n507-765-3852 |\n|\nRoxane Kraling\nCounty Recorder\nCourthouse 101 Fillmore St., PO BOX 466\nPreston, MN 55965 |\nThe Fillmore County Recorder/ Registrar of Titles and Staff are committed to evaluating and processing documents, recording/filing, and generating archival records in compliance with statutory laws and do so with the highest possible degree of accuracy and quality for the citizens and landowners of Fillmore County, including all Abstract and Torrens Properties within the County.\nFor your convenience, Fillmore County has 2 online searchable archives, IDoc Market (all documents 1964- to current) and Arca Search (deeds only 1853-1963). Please see Related Pages at the left for application and subscription purchase, a credit card is required.\nProperty Fraud Alert Protection Information\nFillmore County Recorder's Office also maintains records on documentation of Vitals (birth and death records only). Please see Related Pages under Records Services for an application.\nOnline Plat Map Search: Online Plat Search\n***If you are interested in purchasing a Plat Book , please contact SWCD at 507-887-0240. Address: 912 Houston Street NW, Suite #3 Preston, Minnesota 55965\nOther services offered: Abstracting (new & updating)\nTract Reports, O&E's (current owner)\n40-yr Reports\nName Searches\nFor additional information see \"Abstract Fee Schedule\" under Related Pages.\n***Fillmore County accepts check, cash, money order or credit cards. Please note there is a 3% finance charge by the credit card entity to process these transactions and is collected with payment.\nMilitary Service discharges are filed through the Fillmore County Veterans' Services Office at no charge to the veteran. For all of your Veteran needs and/or questions please contact Veterans Services Officer Jason Marquardt at 507-765-4405.\nShare this page\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.co.fillmore.mn.us/departments/recorder/index.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nReddit\nClose\nEmployee Resources\nCounty Email\nIntranet\nTimekeeping System\nVPN\nContact\n101 Fillmore Street\nPreston, MN 55965\nDirectory\nAbout Us\nFillmore County is located on the southern border of Minnesota. Named for Millard Fillmore, the 13th President of the United States, our community is both agricultural and historic.\nFillmore County Mission Statement: Fillmore County's mission is to provide quality services to its citizens in an efficient, cost-effective manner.\n© 2026 Fillmore CO | Powered by revize , The Government Website Experts |\nLogin\nundefined\nundefined\nundefined",
